<section class=\"section container\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>A few possible arrangements.</h2><p>All capacities and durations below are illustrative.<br>No actual venue limits or availability are implied.</p></div><div class=\"arrangement-grid\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">01 / The record room</p><h3>12–20 listeners</h3><p>A seated, hosted record evening with two complete album sides and a break for conversation. Example duration: two hours.</p></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">02 / The close-up set</p><h3>20–30 listeners</h3><p>A small acoustic duo, two focused sets, and an unhurried interval. Example duration: two and a half hours.</p></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / The whole evening</p><h3>30–40 guests</h3><p>A relaxed gathering with a dedicated seated listening moment. Example duration: three hours. Layout would need venue confirmation.</p></article></div></section>
<section class=\"section container event-process\"><div><?php blue_hour_photo( 'hero' ); ?></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">From a thought to an evening</p><h2>Give the night a shape.</h2><ol><li><strong>Share the occasion.</strong> Set a mood, a group size, and a preferred date.</li><li><strong>Choose the sound.</strong> Imagine a live duo or a hosted record selection.</li><li><strong>Consider the room.</strong> Confirm access, seating, hospitality, and timing with a real operator before any booking.</li></ol><details><summary>Are prices or catering included?</summary><p>No packages, prices, catering commitments, or real bookings are offered by this sample. These arrangements illustrate possibilities only.</p></details><?php blue_hour_link( '/contact/', 'Open the sample booking notebook ↗', 'text-link' ); ?></div></section>
