<section class=\"container prose section\"><h2>The sample inquiry</h2><p>The Blue Hour form runs a local completeness check only. It does not send email, take payments, create reservations, or save your entries. Please use fictional information when trying it.</p><h2>Local assets and browsing</h2><p>The theme loads its styles, scripts, and photographs locally. It adds no analytics trackers, remote fonts, or marketing cookies. A WordPress installation, its hosting provider, or additional plugins may have separate logging and cookie behavior.</p><h2>External photo credits</h2><p>The image-credit links lead to Unsplash. If you follow them, that website's own privacy practices apply. The photographs here are local copies approved in the theme asset manifest.</p><h2>About this brand</h2><p>Blue Hour is a fictional listening room. Its program names, dates, set times, capacity examples, and venue descriptions are illustrative. There is no physical venue or actual ticket inventory.</p><h2>For a future operator</h2><p>Before collecting real inquiries, publish privacy information appropriate to the actual operator, form provider, hosting, retention practices, and contact arrangements.</p><?php blue_hour_link( '/', 'Return to Blue Hour ↗', 'button' ); ?></section>
